<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanqishu" book-id="b-nanqishu-032" chapter-id="c-nanqishu-032-wangchang" source-id="s-nanqishu-032-wangchang-ws1513918">
  <p id="c-nanqishu-032-wangchang:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">初，從兄<persName id="c-nanqishu-032-wangchang:p001:m0004" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAFAB">華</persName>孫<persName id="c-nanqishu-032-wangchang:p001:m0006" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAFABAA">長</persName>襲<persName id="c-nanqishu-032-wangchang:p001:m0008" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAFAB">華</persName>爵爲新建侯，嗜酒多諐失。<persName id="c-nanqishu-032-wangchang:p001:m0021" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAFBA">琨</persName>上表曰：「臣門姪不休，從孫<persName id="c-nanqishu-032-wangchang:p001:m0035" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAFABAA">長</persName>是故左衞將軍<persName id="c-nanqishu-032-wangchang:p001:m0042" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAFABA">嗣</persName>息，少資常猥，猶冀晚進。頃更昏酣，業身無檢。故衞將軍<persName id="c-nanqishu-032-wangchang:p001:m0069" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAFAB">華</persName>忠肅奉國，善及世祀；而<persName id="c-nanqishu-032-wangchang:p001:m0081" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAFABAA">長</persName>負釁承封，將傾基緒。</p>
</text>
